{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/core/core_transport_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:35:05.875270Z","id":"a8f0b4ea9d8dddaa84d794efe5bf5375ac1327af5096c00dfbc064d437af140d","body":{"detail":"Not covered: (1) an answered call cancels its deadline timer (the _HeldTimer's isActive is never read) and an answer arriving after a timeout is dropped; (2) a cancel while the resubscribe delay is pending opens no new subscription (resumes unchanged, core.subscribers 0 once the delay completes); (3) SseClaxStream over CoreTransport across a stream_ended: the new subscription is a new stream (CoreClient ignores lastEventId, lib/core/core_client.dart:204-207), so topics are subscribed again and each gets resync 'reconnect'; (4) ClaxStream.events ending with an error on core_closed; (5) x-clax-session is asserted on createArtifact only, not on pollFeedback's session route or a poll's deadline of wait + pollSlack over the core.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":306},"content_hash":"ca1bac026579cba2ee7b2236ceba8cb9ac090ac33f7af7941242f8bda23115e5"},"suggested_fix":"Add those five cases; (3) and (4) belong with 'the stream delivers a pushed version to its artifact's topic'.","summary":"core_transport_test leaves the stream's lifecycle over the core and the deadline's cleanup untested","tags":["review","test-gap","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/core/core_transport_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T09:53:29.924216Z","id":"2e450b6e2576ddbdb4747ee9013ea1a047462b5636d223866cfb5602c3d9866a","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"The five cases are in core_transport_test: 'an answer after the time limit is dropped, and one in time stops the deadline', 'a cancel while the stream waits to subscribe again opens no subscription', 'across a stream the core ended, the topics are subscribed again and resynced', 'the stream's events end with an error when the core closes', 'a feedback poll is an owner call on its session, given wait + pollSlack' (pollFeedback names the session in its path and carries no x-clax-session, as over loopback). Evidence: //apps/clax_app:core_core_transport_test PASSED; each failed under a mutation of the code it covers (deadline.cancel removed, onCancel's cancelled flag removed, SseClaxStream's _restore call removed, core_closed retried, the poll's limit without pollSlack).","supersedes":"a8f0b4ea9d8dddaa84d794efe5bf5375ac1327af5096c00dfbc064d437af140d","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
